Output examples/demo/out/confirm.gif

Set Shell bash
Set Width 1200
Set Height 320
Set FontSize 22
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./xylitol.sh confirm && echo confirmed || echo cancelled"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Right
Sleep 900ms
Left
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
